{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Astronomical 2 is a fast top-down space shooter where you fly your own ship and blast through enemies. It\u2019s a sequel to the first Astronomical, but bigger, louder, and more alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More missions, more enemies, more upgrades, and more fire.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984770/extras/ed57403f089626d793d83154ff7d9a65.avif?t=1767432010\" width=640 height=132 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kill Them All \u2013 round-based fights, find every enemy, and destroy them, no mercy.<br>Payload \u2013 protect a civilian ship and make sure it reaches the end while enemies try to blow it up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend The Point - keep a defending point safe from enemies until they give up.<br>Boss Fights \u2013 big battles against huge ships that test everything you\u2019ve got, destroy them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more in the future!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984770/extras/5613928660a7bb099bec8d8c9913f69e.avif?t=1767432010\" width=640 height=132 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced space shooter action.<br>Different mission types to keep things fresh.<br>Custom guns and ship upgrades.<br>Alot of Different enemies and big bosses.<br>More content coming with updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More on that after launch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make it through space, or be consumed by the blue fire?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984770?t=1767432010","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984770/13c5cacb6a70aa4ce51095232aee6d9db8c17182/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=176